msgid "Saved games"
msgstr "Saved games"

msgid "Save screenshots"
msgstr "Save screenshots"

msgid "No preview available"
msgstr "No preview available"

msgid "Capture the game scene when a save succeeds and show it below the save list in Load Game. Works with manual saves, quicksaves and autosaves. Old saves remain loadable without a preview."
msgstr "Capture the game scene when a save succeeds and show it below the save list in Load Game. Works with manual saves, quicksaves and autosaves. Old saves remain loadable without a preview."

